// Cintugnatos, the vates of Brigodunon: the shrine, the grotto, healing.
=== start
[flag vates_met] -> again
~ set vates_met
The vates is on his knees by the altar stone, picking splinters of the offering box out of the grass one by one, as if he could put it back together.

"They came in the night before last. Took the box, the silver in it, the bronze, and the Roman stick." He sits back on his heels. "I followed the tracks as far as the stream. They go northeast, toward the Grotto of the Hanging Dead. Men have been living there since the autumn. Dubnacos's men."
~ quest grotto start; known grotto
* "Dubnacos? The one who was exiled?" -> dubnacos
* "The Grotto of the Hanging Dead?" -> grotto
* "I'll get it back." -> END

=== again
[quest hostages=reported] -> north
"{name}." He nods. "What is it?"
-> hub

=== north
"The gods go with you, north. They're not much use, mostly, but they go."
-> hub

